&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is highly analytical and execution-focused, requiring strong organizational skills, business judgment, and the ability to interpret signals from across the company. Success is measured by forecast accuracy, schedule attainment, capacity&amp;nbsp;utilization, revenue predictability, and the organization&#39;s ability to execute against&amp;nbsp;plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
