&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MISUMI Americas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MISUMI Americas, a division of MISUMI Group, is a leading provider of standard, configurable, and custom manufacturing solutions. By integrating a vast catalog of components with a world-class digital manufacturing platform, MISUMI Americas empowers engineers and procurement teams to accelerate innovation across the entire product lifecycle. With operations in the San Francisco Bay Area and Chicago, the company serves as a vital partner for the most innovative companies in the Americas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Impact In This Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Product Manager for Manufacturing Business Systems, you will shape and drive the internal systems that power Fictiv and MISUMI Americas’ manufacturing operations — including PLM, ERP, TMS, MRP, and other business systems we adopt or build over time to support how the business runs. You will contribute to the strategy and roadmap for this systems landscape and own the execution of solutions that deliver against it, balancing customer satisfaction, growth, reliable delivery, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is focused on solution implementation and optimization rather than IT support. You&#39;ll identify and validate business opportunities that can be unlocked through technology, partner with engineering to define the right solution, build the business case for the investment, and drive execution from planning through implementation, qualification, and launch. The solutions you contribute to are foundational to the MISUMI Americas manufacturing business - enabling it to scale, deliver differentiated value, and drive growth by serving product innovators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Areas of Responsibility&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Business acumen and domain awareness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Research and evaluate the needs of internal users (operations, finance, supply chain, engineering, IT) to understand priorities and pain points within manufacturing workflows, and assess their feedback on current systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understand the needs of Fictiv and MISUMI America&#39;s customers, and how the workflows and tools used by internal teams shape the experience those customers receive. Use that lens to identify and evaluate opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop deep knowledge of Fictiv and MISUMI America&#39;s PLM, ERP, and other manufacturing business systems — including data models, integrations, and dependencies — and translate that knowledge into product opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Assess the needs of our growing network of manufacturing partners where they touch internal systems, and identify opportunities to improve data flow, traceability, and partner experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the strategy and roadmap for evolving the manufacturing business systems landscape to support Fictiv and MISUMI Americas’ growth trajectory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Roadmap execution and project delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze, comprehend, and take ownership of the assigned roadmap items related to manufacturing business systems and translate high-level goals into detailed objectives and projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to building the business case for system investments (new systems, modules, configurations, integrations) and secure alignment on those investments with leadership and stakeholders.Develop a framework for tracking input and output metrics that provides a quantitative view of the success and impact of each project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Scope and define requirements for each roadmap item to ensure clarity and alignment with product and operational objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Surface trade-offs between speed of delivery, configuration vs. customization, and long-term scalability of the architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively identify risks (data, integration, change management) and work with teams to develop mitigation strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Based on research, analysis, and deep understanding of the problem space, develop conviction in your product initiatives and vision, and communicate them effectively across the business to drive awareness and alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strong working relationships with stakeholders across operations, finance, supply chain, engineering, IT, and external system implementers and vendors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with cross-functional partners — software engineering, IT, UX, operations, finance, sales, and marketing — to develop hypotheses and high-impact solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead scoping and prioritization discussions across teams, bringing the right people in at the right time and incorporating their feedback to sharpen the work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Execution and risk management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Use Agile methodologies to organize and manage sprints across development and configuration work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze metrics to measure success and optimize systems for business outcomes and strategic priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Keep stakeholders informed of progress, milestones, risks, and timeline changes as work progresses.Partner with development and configuration teams in India and the US, communicating business needs, requirements, and priorities while removing friction where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive launches and go-lives by ensuring the organization is prepared, including training and change management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Travel 10% annually for team meetings, research, and training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain a daily time overlap with stakeholders in India and China to facilitate communication with collaborating development teams, stakeholders, and users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Demands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The physical demands described here are representative of those that must be met by an employee to successfully perform the essential functions of this job. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;While performing the duties of this job, the employee routinely is required to sit; walk; talk and hear; use hands to keyboard, fingers, handle, and feel; stoop, kneel, crouch, twist, crawl, reach, and stretch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Traits, Qualifications, Education and Experience Equivalency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Past Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a product manager, business systems analyst, or application manager working directly on manufacturing business systems such as PLM, ERP, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of taking business problems or opportunities, translating them into actionable plans, and driving them through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating systems with interdependencies and integrations, and the ability to manage complex technical landscapes.Experience in business analysis, optimizing internal workflows, and considering downstream impact on customers and end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience leveraging user insights and metrics to drive strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desired&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the manufacturing service provider business model (contract manufacturers, job shops, on-demand manufacturing platforms, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in manufacturing, supply chains, or industries where intricate processes and logistical considerations are important to product development and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some operating or technical knowledge in one or more manufacturing processes (3D Printing, CNC, Injection Molding, Sheet Metal, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing, configuring, or developing on PLM or ERP platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desired Traits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills to break high-level goals into actionable tasks and requirements, synthesizing insights and data to drive high-quality product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to rally cross-functional teams behind a product vision, collaborate across multiple time zones, and document decisions clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-driven mindset with a focus on delivering high-quality outcomes within defined timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and influence without authority: operate proactively, with empathy and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working, negotiating, and communicating with internal users, customers, vendors, implementation partners, and leadership to develop insights about needs and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Salary Range: $150K - $185K per year, depending upon experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in learning more?&amp;nbsp; We look forward to hearing from you soon.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re actively seeking teammates who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring diverse perspectives and experience to our culture and company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at being part of a strong, empathetic team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in an environment emphasizing respect, honesty, collaboration, and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an ‘always learning’ mindset that celebrates learning, not just wins.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help us continue to build a world-class organization that values the contributions of all of our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage applications from members of underrepresented groups, including but not limited to women, members of the LGBTQ community, people of color, people with disabilities, and veterans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-cerebral:greenhouse:5869397003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Cerebral and Resilience Lab have joined forces to&lt;strong&gt; build a new standard in mental health care&lt;/strong&gt;—one that emphasizes better outcomes through &lt;strong&gt;stronger clinical decision-making&lt;/strong&gt;, rigorous training, and professional excellence. By combining Resilience Lab’s Methodology &amp;amp; clinically-led training Institute with Cerebral’s extensive reach, clinical network, and care capabilities, we are creating a national model for high-quality, integrated, and accessible behavioral health care.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe quality mental health care starts with curiosity, professionalism, and mastery of clinical decision-making. Joining our team means committing to show up on your best foot every day where you’ll be equipped with structured training, supportive supervision, and a methodology designed to guide you in making sound clinical decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a licensed Collaborating Psychiatrist to support our mission in improving access to high-quality mental health care! In this role, you will function as a collaborating supervisor for our Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioners in applicable states.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is a 1099 independent contractor role estimated at 5-15 hours per month, depending on the number of NPs you’re collaborating with. Must reside and be licensed in Georgia.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold an active MD/DO license in good standing in Georgia&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;National Board Certification as a Psychiatrist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong clinical background within Psychiatry, Family Medicine, Integrative Medicine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health experience and a minimum of 2+ years’ experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong evidence-based clinical skill set while practicing &amp;amp; implementing outcome-focused care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic and intuitive listening&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable in crisis response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working autonomously in a telemedicine environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savvy with the ability to navigate various systems &amp;amp; tools with ease (this includes, but is not limited to Google Workspace, proprietary EMR, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about our mission of improving access to high-quality mental health care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial spirit or previous experience within a startup or fast-paced environment is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How your skills and passion will come to life at Cerebral:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the most beneficial level of treatment is implemented for our clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with the PMHNP team and conduct patient chart audits on a monthly basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct a minimum of three patient chart audits per month per nurse practitioner that you are supervising; requirements will vary based on states regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold a monthly 1-hour office hour (or two 30-minute sessions) for designated nurse practitioners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and assess that proper documentation and appropriate interventions are being implemented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fulfill any state-specific requirement as a collaborator (attendance in meetings, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be clinically strong, function autonomously and competently, and utilize critical thinking skills to provide appropriate triage care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each nurse practitioner that you supervise will roughly be an hour of work per individual per month (must abide by state rules and regulations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create your own flexible schedule based on your individual availability! Scheduled time must fall within the hours of 6:00am to 11:30pm per your specific timezone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside other like-minded clinicians that have a common goal to positively impact the lives of others, and create an environment that leads to favorable outcomes for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mission-driven impact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of the #1 largest and fastest growing online mental health care company in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a platform that is improving the lives and well-being of hundreds of thousands of people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a community of high achievers who have a passion for promoting mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Path to develop &amp;amp; grow:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Readily available psychiatrists and clinician leadership for case consultations to ensure you always receive the support you need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to innovative technology to support you in delivering the highest quality of care to your clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to UpToDate for continued education (free CEU offering)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first model:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to choose the hours and schedule that work best for you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work virtually from anywhere in the United States&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture &amp;amp; connectivity:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly-responsive and supportive team of clinical and operational management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decreased administrative time for clinicians through ongoing technology improvements and automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully integrated, data-enabled EMR with embedded clinical decision support, monthly prescriber metric reports, and task management system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to participate in strategic development initiatives to improve our clinical quality and safety and/or clinical processes across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are (our company values):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Deliver Client Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Relentlessly focusing on advancing personalized, high-quality, evidence-based care that improves people&#39;s lives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are One:&lt;/strong&gt; Bringing our collective expertise together as a unified team, strengthened by collaboration, trust, diversity of thought and shared purpose&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Aim Higher: &lt;/strong&gt;Continuously curious to drive our learning, our innovation and our personal growth to reach our full potential&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Generous: &lt;/strong&gt;Giving more than we take with compassion, empathy, support, openness and a willingness to help those in need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Accountable:&lt;/strong&gt; Acting with courage, conviction and integrity to achieve our goals and ambitions to improve the lives of our clients&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cerebral is committed to bringing together humans from different backgrounds and perspectives, providing employees with a safe and welcoming work environment free of discrimination and harassment. As an equal opportunity employer, we prohibit any unlawful discrimination against a job applicant on the basis of their race, color, religion, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, national origin, family or parental status, disability, age, veteran status, or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we operate. We respect the laws enforced by the EEOC and are dedicated to going above and beyond in fostering diversity across our workplace.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;___________________&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Cerebral, Inc. is a management services organization that provides health information technology, information management system, and non-clinical administrative support services for various medical practices, including Cerebral Medical Group, PA and its affiliated practices (CMG), who are solely responsible for providing and overseeing all clinical matters. Cerebral, Inc. does not provide healthcare services, employ any healthcare provider, own any medical practice (including CMG), or control or attempt to control any provider or the provision of any healthcare service. “Cerebral” is the brand name commonly used by Cerebral, Inc. and CMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-cookunity:greenhouse:7147564003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About CookUnity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Food has lost its soul to modern convenience. And with it, it has lost the power to nourish, inspire, and connect us. So in 2018, CookUnity was founded as the first-of-its-kind platform that connects the world with the source of truly great food: chefs. Today, CookUnity delivers 50 million meals a year from the industry’s best chefs to homes all over the country. Fresh. Ready-to-eat. And crafted with the passion that nourishes body and soul.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Unwilling to stop there, CookUnity is expanding beyond delivery to become an ever-innovating marketplace focused on our singular mission: &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;empower Chefs to nourish the world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;If that mission has you hungry in more ways than one, you’ve found the right job posting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CookUnity is Hiring for Hourly Roles!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for an opportunity to be part of a fast-growing company that’s revolutionizing the meal delivery industry? CookUnity is looking for dedicated team members-bilingual English/Spanish a plus!-to join our operations and help bring chef-crafted meals to customers nationwide!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Cook Unity &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;CookUnity is a chef-to-you marketplace connecting talented chefs with consumers, revolutionizing meal delivery. We bring small-batch, restaurant-quality meals to eaters nationwide, crafted by a diverse collective of all-star chefs. With over 100 inspired chefs from cities like NYC, LA, Austin, and more, our weekly subscription offers a wide range of hand-crafted meals to cater to various palates and dietary preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By delivering over 1 million meals per month, we&#39;re also empowering working chefs, tripling their income, and supporting their growth. CookUnity believes in fueling stronger communities, partnering with Food Bank For New York City to combat food insecurity across all five boroughs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re currently hiring for the following positions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;Fulfillment Team Member&lt;/strong&gt; – Assist with packaging and preparing meals for delivery.&lt;br&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;Warehouse Team Member&lt;/strong&gt; – Support inventory management, receiving, and storage of ingredients and supplies.&lt;br&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;Maintenance Team Member&lt;/strong&gt; – Help ensure our facilities and equipment are running smoothly.&lt;br&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;Steward&lt;/strong&gt; – Maintain cleanliness and organization in our kitchen and workspaces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join CookUnity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;✨ Competitive hourly pay&lt;br&gt;✨ Growth opportunities within the company&lt;br&gt;✨ A dynamic and inclusive work environment&lt;br&gt;✨ Be part of a mission-driven company bringing quality meals to people’s doorsteps&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 &lt;strong&gt;Locations:&lt;/strong&gt; Toronto, CA&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to apply?&lt;/strong&gt; Submit your application today and become part of a team that’s passionate about food and innovation!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to meeting you! 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re interested in this role, please submit your application, and if we think you might be a fit, we&#39;ll get in touch with you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Thank you for your time!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CookUnity is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;. We are dedicated to creating a community of inclusion and an environment free from discrimination or harassment. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, citizenship status, protected veteran status, genetic information, or physical or mental disability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick note for all candidates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams across the industry, and we want to make sure you (and your data)&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;stay safe while applying to CookUnity.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We also want you to know that we take this seriously — sometimes, as part of our process, we may ask for a brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;“proof of humanity”&lt;/strong&gt; to confirm that we’re connecting with a real person, not an impersonator. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Here are a few tips to help you protect yourself and know what to expect from us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
