&lt;h2&gt;Under AnyMind&#39;s group management model, we offer opportunities to engage in professional exchange with the Group Finance team, allowing you to continuously enhance your skills through cross-department collaboration. We also highly value personal growth, providing an environment where your knowledge and expertise in finance can expand without limits. We look forward to having you join us and grow together!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle bank transactions, including cash deposits, withdrawals, remittances, and transfers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and process invoices, receipts, and accounting entries for various expense payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform account reconciliations for various accounts, including TWD, USD, petty cash, and credit cards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage accounts receivable processes such as invoicing, discounts, and voiding.&lt;/li&gt;
