&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transition Team RNs &amp;amp; LPNs – Earn up to $40/hour at BAYADA!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be the &lt;strong&gt;pediatric nurse&lt;/strong&gt; you’ve always wanted to be with BAYADA Home Health Care!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have immediate openings on our &lt;strong&gt;Transition Team&lt;/strong&gt; for RNs and LPNs passionate about caring for infants and young children as they transition from hospital to home in the Lehigh and Northampton County area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a high-tech pediatric nurse, you’ve chosen a career that is both challenging and deeply rewarding—and our Transition Team allows you to make an even greater impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, team-based environment as an extension of our HICU® team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide skilled, high-quality care to pediatric clients in the comfort of their homes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support families during the critical early stages of home care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver hands-on training to caregivers and ongoing care teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Our Transition Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to offer our Transition Team Nurses:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship and professional development opportunities, including free courses and hands-on training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive, growth-focused team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stable and reliable scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee referral bonuses and additional incentives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on skill level, licensure, and shift differentials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible full-time and part-time schedules (8–12 hour shifts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health Coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Medical, dental, vision, prescription plans, plus FSA and HSA options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recognition &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; Nurse Hero program, recognition initiatives, and referral bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; PTO with no accrual limit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reimbursements:&lt;/strong&gt; Potential mileage reimbursement and/or schedule-specific benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Employer-paid coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Benefits may vary by position—connect with a recruiter to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active RN or LPN license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of one year of verifiable nursing experience (pediatric experience preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in NICU, PICU, ICU, or home care with trach/vent highly preferred &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve a passing score on high-tech pediatric simulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current CPR certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to educate and support the ongoing BAYADA care team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to a consistent schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 1 hour within Lehigh and Northampton counties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability for at least 2 weekend shifts per month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and flexible to support team and client scheduling needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a Culture That Cares&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BAYADA, we put your well-being first creating an inclusive, collaborative environment where you can grow and succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Named a &lt;em&gt;Forbes Best Employer for Women (2020)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized as a &lt;em&gt;Glassdoor Best Place to Work (2018 &amp;amp; 2019)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awarded &lt;em&gt;America’s Greatest Workplaces for Diversity (2023)&lt;/em&gt; by Newsweek&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Celebrated 50 years in the business of serving our communities &lt;em&gt;(2025)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong culture rooted in compassion, excellence, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small, local tenured teams that make a big impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BAYADA, we believe &lt;strong&gt;children belong at home&lt;/strong&gt;—and you can play a vital role in making that possible. Join a team where your expertise truly changes lives. We can’t wait to meet you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;MAR-EPA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA is celebrating 50 years of compassion, excellence, and reliability. Learn more about our 50th anniversary celebration and how you can join in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/50&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care, Inc., and its associated entities and joint venture partners, are Equal Opportunity Employers. All employment decisions are made on a non-discriminatory basis without regard to sex, race, color, age, disability, pregnancy or maternity, sexual orientation, gender identity, citizenship status, military status, or any other similarly protected status in accordance with federal, state and local laws. &amp;nbsp;Hence, we strongly encourage applications from people with these identities or who are members of other marginalized communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

